{"a1": [{"n": "01", "text": "If you're about to try the Ferber method, the hardest question at bedtime is simple: how long do I wait before I go in?", "screen": "Title card: \"The Ferber chart, night by night\"", "start": 0.0, "end": 6.6, "words": [{"w": "if", "s": 0.0}, {"w": "youre", "s": 0.16}, {"w": "about", "s": 0.28}, {"w": "to", "s": 0.48}, {"w": "try", "s": 0.7}, {"w": "the", "s": 0.9}, {"w": "ferber", "s": 1.06}, {"w": "method", "s": 1.4}, {"w": "the", "s": 2.12}, {"w": "hardest", "s": 2.18}, {"w": "question", "s": 2.52}, {"w": "at", "s": 2.84}, {"w": "bedtime", "s": 3.16}, {"w": "is", "s": 3.56}, {"w": "simple", "s": 3.82}, {"w": "how", "s": 4.84}, {"w": "long", "s": 4.98}, {"w": "do", "s": 5.18}, {"w": "i", "s": 5.36}, {"w": "wait", "s": 5.48}, {"w": "before", "s": 5.68}, {"w": "i", "s": 5.98}, {"w": "go", "s": 6.22}, {"w": "in", "s": 6.38}]}, {"n": "02", "text": "I'm a parent. After sleep training our own baby, I built a timer app for it called Check In. But first, the chart, because it's the thing I wished someone had walked me through.", "screen": "Moon icon, \"Made by a parent\"; small \"Check In\" tag appears in the corner and stays for the rest of the video", "start": 7.1, "end": 16.64, "words": [{"w": "im", "s": 7.1}, {"w": "a", "s": 7.32}, {"w": "parent", "s": 7.38}, {"w": "after", "s": 8.2}, {"w": "sleep", "s": 8.4}, {"w": "training", "s": 8.64}, {"w": "our", "s": 8.9}, {"w": "own", "s": 9.14}, {"w": "baby", "s": 9.36}, {"w": "i", "s": 9.98}, {"w": "built", "s": 10.14}, {"w": "a", "s": 10.28}, {"w": "timer", "s": 10.44}, {"w": "app", "s": 10.7}, {"w": "for", "s": 10.96}, {"w": "it", "s": 11.22}, {"w": "called", "s": 11.38}, {"w": "check", "s": 11.58}, {"w": "in", "s": 11.82}, {"w": "but", "s": 12.42}, {"w": "first", "s": 12.62}, {"w": "the", "s": 13.18}, {"w": "chart", "s": 13.32}, {"w": "because", "s": 13.84}, {"w": "its", "s": 14.14}, {"w": "the", "s": 14.52}, {"w": "thing", "s": 14.64}, {"w": "i", "s": 14.86}, {"w": "wished", "s": 15.06}, {"w": "someone", "s": 15.32}, {"w": "had", "s": 15.72}, {"w": "walked", "s": 15.98}, {"w": "me", "s": 16.2}, {"w": "through", "s": 16.42}]}, {"n": "03", "text": "Here's the idea in one sentence. You put your baby down awake, you leave, and if they cry, you wait a set number of minutes before a short check-in. The waits get a little longer each time, and each night.", "screen": "Three icons: bed, door, clock", "start": 17.18, "end": 29.08, "words": [{"w": "heres", "s": 17.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 17.48}, {"w": "idea", "s": 17.58}, {"w": "in", "s": 17.84}, {"w": "one", "s": 18.14}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 18.36}, {"w": "you", "s": 19.5}, {"w": "put", "s": 19.56}, {"w": "your", "s": 19.72}, {"w": "baby", "s": 19.86}, {"w": "down", "s": 20.08}, {"w": "awake", "s": 20.36}, {"w": "you", "s": 21.06}, {"w": "leave", "s": 21.26}, {"w": "and", "s": 22.02}, {"w": "if", "s": 22.18}, {"w": "they", "s": 22.28}, {"w": "cry", "s": 22.4}, {"w": "you", "s": 23.16}, {"w": "wait", "s": 23.26}, {"w": "a", "s": 23.4}, {"w": "set", "s": 23.5}, {"w": "number", "s": 23.74}, {"w": "of", "s": 24.0}, {"w": "minutes", "s": 24.22}, {"w": "before", "s": 24.44}, {"w": "a", "s": 24.9}, {"w": "short", "s": 25.08}, {"w": "check", "s": 25.26}, {"w": "in", "s": 25.58}, {"w": "the", "s": 26.16}, {"w": "weights", "s": 26.34}, {"w": "get", "s": 26.52}, {"w": "a", "s": 26.78}, {"w": "little", "s": 26.9}, {"w": "longer", "s": 27.12}, {"w": "each", "s": 27.48}, {"w": "time", "s": 27.74}, {"w": "and", "s": 28.14}, {"w": "each", "s": 28.56}, {"w": "night", "s": 28.76}]}, {"n": "04", "text": "This is the chart most families use. Each row is one night. Each number is how many minutes to wait before a check-in.", "screen": "Full chart appears", "start": 29.08, "end": 36.08, "words": [{"w": "this", "s": 29.08}, {"w": "is", "s": 29.78}, {"w": "the", "s": 29.94}, {"w": "chart", "s": 30.1}, {"w": "most", "s": 30.3}, {"w": "families", "s": 30.56}, {"w": "use", "s": 31.0}, {"w": "each", "s": 31.98}, {"w": "row", "s": 32.04}, {"w": "is", "s": 32.32}, {"w": "one", "s": 32.62}, {"w": "night", "s": 32.84}, {"w": "each", "s": 33.6}, {"w": "number", "s": 33.72}, {"w": "is", "s": 34.14}, {"w": "how", "s": 34.48}, {"w": "many", "s": 34.7}, {"w": "minutes", "s": 34.86}, {"w": "to", "s": 35.18}, {"w": "wait", "s": 35.42}, {"w": "before", "s": 35.58}, {"w": "a", "s": 35.94}, {"w": "check", "s": 36.08}, {"w": "in", "s": 36.24}]}, {"n": "05", "text": "Night one. Wait three minutes before the first check-in. Then five minutes. Then ten minutes, and keep repeating ten until they're asleep.", "screen": "Row 1 highlights: 3, 5, 10", "start": 36.82, "end": 44.52, "words": [{"w": "night", "s": 36.82}, {"w": "one", "s": 37.08}, {"w": "wait", "s": 37.92}, {"w": "three", "s": 37.96}, {"w": "minutes", "s": 38.26}, {"w": "before", "s": 38.6}, {"w": "the", "s": 38.88}, {"w": "first", "s": 39.12}, {"w": "check", "s": 39.34}, {"w": "in", "s": 39.6}, {"w": "then", "s": 40.18}, {"w": "five", "s": 40.36}, {"w": "minutes", "s": 40.6}, {"w": "then", "s": 41.5}, {"w": "ten", "s": 41.6}, {"w": "minutes", "s": 41.84}, {"w": "and", "s": 42.52}, {"w": "keep", "s": 42.68}, {"w": "repeating", "s": 42.9}, {"w": "ten", "s": 43.24}, {"w": "until", "s": 43.6}, {"w": "theyre", "s": 44.04}, {"w": "asleep", "s": 44.28}]}, {"n": "06", "text": "Night two moves up. Five minutes, then ten, then twelve.", "screen": "Row 2: 5, 10, 12", "start": 45.16, "end": 48.72, "words": [{"w": "night", "s": 45.16}, {"w": "two", "s": 45.22}, {"w": "moves", "s": 45.52}, {"w": "up", "s": 45.84}, {"w": "five", "s": 46.7}, {"w": "minutes", "s": 46.76}, {"w": "then", "s": 47.52}, {"w": "ten", "s": 47.66}, {"w": "then", "s": 48.38}, {"w": "twelve", "s": 48.52}]}, {"n": "07", "text": "Night three. Ten, then twelve, then fifteen.", "screen": "Row 3: 10, 12, 15", "start": 49.42, "end": 52.2, "words": [{"w": "night", "s": 49.42}, {"w": "three", "s": 49.56}, {"w": "ten", "s": 50.38}, {"w": "then", "s": 51.02}, {"w": "twelve", "s": 51.1}, {"w": "then", "s": 51.8}, {"w": "fifteen", "s": 51.9}]}, {"n": "08", "text": "And it keeps building, a little each night, until night seven: twenty, twenty-five, then thirty. After night seven, you just keep using that last row.", "screen": "Rows 4 to 7 fill in", "start": 52.2, "end": 61.94, "words": [{"w": "and", "s": 52.2}, {"w": "it", "s": 53.0}, {"w": "keeps", "s": 53.08}, {"w": "building", "s": 53.3}, {"w": "a", "s": 53.66}, {"w": "little", "s": 54.22}, {"w": "each", "s": 54.48}, {"w": "night", "s": 54.72}, {"w": "until", "s": 55.02}, {"w": "night", "s": 55.52}, {"w": "seven", "s": 55.84}, {"w": "twenty", "s": 56.62}, {"w": "twenty", "s": 57.32}, {"w": "five", "s": 57.48}, {"w": "then", "s": 58.2}, {"w": "thirty", "s": 58.4}, {"w": "after", "s": 59.24}, {"w": "night", "s": 59.52}, {"w": "seven", "s": 59.72}, {"w": "you", "s": 60.32}, {"w": "just", "s": 60.42}, {"w": "keep", "s": 60.64}, {"w": "using", "s": 60.86}, {"w": "that", "s": 61.14}, {"w": "last", "s": 61.4}, {"w": "row", "s": 61.58}]}, {"n": "09", "text": "Two rules make the chart work. First, only count while your baby is actually crying. If the crying stops, the wait stops. If it starts again, start that same wait over.", "screen": "\u201cOnly count crying\u201d with a pause icon", "start": 62.48, "end": 72.68, "words": [{"w": "two", "s": 62.48}, {"w": "rules", "s": 62.64}, {"w": "make", "s": 62.96}, {"w": "the", "s": 63.24}, {"w": "chart", "s": 63.4}, {"w": "work", "s": 63.58}, {"w": "first", "s": 64.44}, {"w": "only", "s": 65.0}, {"w": "count", "s": 65.38}, {"w": "while", "s": 65.64}, {"w": "your", "s": 65.88}, {"w": "baby", "s": 66.02}, {"w": "is", "s": 66.3}, {"w": "actually", "s": 66.5}, {"w": "crying", "s": 66.94}, {"w": "if", "s": 67.92}, {"w": "the", "s": 68.02}, {"w": "crying", "s": 68.12}, {"w": "stops", "s": 68.34}, {"w": "the", "s": 69.1}, {"w": "weight", "s": 69.2}, {"w": "stops", "s": 69.34}, {"w": "if", "s": 70.26}, {"w": "it", "s": 70.32}, {"w": "starts", "s": 70.44}, {"w": "again", "s": 70.62}, {"w": "start", "s": 71.4}, {"w": "that", "s": 71.54}, {"w": "same", "s": 71.78}, {"w": "weight", "s": 72.08}, {"w": "over", "s": 72.38}]}, {"n": "10", "text": "Second, check-ins are short. One or two minutes. A pat, a few calm words, and then you leave, even if they're still crying.", "screen": "\u201c1 to 2 minutes\u201d, hand-on-crib icon", "start": 73.26, "end": 80.94, "words": [{"w": "second", "s": 73.26}, {"w": "check", "s": 74.0}, {"w": "ins", "s": 74.08}, {"w": "are", "s": 74.26}, {"w": "short", "s": 74.5}, {"w": "one", "s": 75.42}, {"w": "or", "s": 75.52}, {"w": "two", "s": 75.74}, {"w": "minutes", "s": 75.96}, {"w": "a", "s": 76.8}, {"w": "pat", "s": 76.9}, {"w": "a", "s": 77.48}, {"w": "few", "s": 77.62}, {"w": "calm", "s": 77.82}, {"w": "words", "s": 78.06}, {"w": "and", "s": 78.7}, {"w": "then", "s": 78.86}, {"w": "you", "s": 78.98}, {"w": "leave", "s": 79.12}, {"w": "even", "s": 79.74}, {"w": "if", "s": 80.02}, {"w": "theyre", "s": 80.22}, {"w": "still", "s": 80.4}, {"w": "crying", "s": 80.62}]}, {"n": "11", "text": "That part surprised me. You're not going in to stop the crying. You're going in to reassure them that you're close, and then you step out.", "screen": "Quote style: \"Reassure, not stop the crying\"", "start": 80.94, "end": 88.92, "words": [{"w": "that", "s": 80.94}, {"w": "part", "s": 81.66}, {"w": "surprised", "s": 81.9}, {"w": "me", "s": 82.12}, {"w": "youre", "s": 83.08}, {"w": "not", "s": 83.18}, {"w": "going", "s": 83.3}, {"w": "in", "s": 83.6}, {"w": "to", "s": 83.76}, {"w": "stop", "s": 83.92}, {"w": "the", "s": 84.2}, {"w": "crying", "s": 84.44}, {"w": "youre", "s": 85.2}, {"w": "going", "s": 85.32}, {"w": "in", "s": 85.56}, {"w": "to", "s": 85.78}, {"w": "reassure", "s": 85.92}, {"w": "them", "s": 86.22}, {"w": "that", "s": 86.64}, {"w": "youre", "s": 86.78}, {"w": "close", "s": 86.92}, {"w": "and", "s": 87.64}, {"w": "then", "s": 87.84}, {"w": "you", "s": 88.08}, {"w": "step", "s": 88.44}, {"w": "out", "s": 88.66}]}, {"n": "12", "text": "What should you expect? Night one is often the longest. Nights two and three are often harder before they get easier. That's normal, and it's the point where a lot of parents give up.", "screen": "Simple bar chart rising at night 2, then falling", "start": 89.36, "end": 99.1, "words": [{"w": "what", "s": 89.36}, {"w": "should", "s": 89.46}, {"w": "you", "s": 89.6}, {"w": "expect", "s": 89.76}, {"w": "night", "s": 90.7}, {"w": "one", "s": 90.86}, {"w": "is", "s": 91.12}, {"w": "often", "s": 91.34}, {"w": "the", "s": 91.66}, {"w": "longest", "s": 91.84}, {"w": "night", "s": 92.76}, {"w": "two", "s": 92.92}, {"w": "and", "s": 93.2}, {"w": "three", "s": 93.38}, {"w": "are", "s": 93.64}, {"w": "often", "s": 93.9}, {"w": "harder", "s": 94.2}, {"w": "before", "s": 94.48}, {"w": "they", "s": 94.9}, {"w": "get", "s": 95.24}, {"w": "easier", "s": 95.38}, {"w": "thats", "s": 96.22}, {"w": "normal", "s": 96.5}, {"w": "and", "s": 97.02}, {"w": "its", "s": 97.22}, {"w": "the", "s": 97.4}, {"w": "point", "s": 97.5}, {"w": "where", "s": 97.74}, {"w": "a", "s": 97.94}, {"w": "lot", "s": 98.04}, {"w": "of", "s": 98.24}, {"w": "parents", "s": 98.36}, {"w": "give", "s": 98.68}, {"w": "up", "s": 98.9}]}, {"n": "13", "text": "In one survey of more than six hundred parents, crying averaged about forty minutes on the first night, and about nine minutes a week later.", "screen": "Two bars: ~43 min \u2192 ~9 min, \"one survey of 652 parents\"", "start": 99.56, "end": 106.78, "words": [{"w": "in", "s": 99.56}, {"w": "one", "s": 99.68}, {"w": "survey", "s": 99.84}, {"w": "of", "s": 100.22}, {"w": "more", "s": 100.5}, {"w": "than", "s": 100.68}, {"w": "600", "s": 100.84}, {"w": "parents", "s": 101.16}, {"w": "crying", "s": 102.22}, {"w": "averaged", "s": 102.46}, {"w": "about", "s": 102.86}, {"w": "40", "s": 103.26}, {"w": "minutes", "s": 103.66}, {"w": "on", "s": 103.94}, {"w": "the", "s": 104.18}, {"w": "first", "s": 104.28}, {"w": "night", "s": 104.48}, {"w": "and", "s": 105.06}, {"w": "about", "s": 105.2}, {"w": "nine", "s": 105.36}, {"w": "minutes", "s": 105.68}, {"w": "a", "s": 106.02}, {"w": "week", "s": 106.26}, {"w": "later", "s": 106.42}]}, {"n": "14", "text": "And the numbers are a guide, not a rule. If shorter waits feel right for your family, use them. What matters most is that the waits grow slowly and you stay consistent.", "screen": "\u201cConsistency beats perfect numbers\u201d", "start": 107.24, "end": 116.14, "words": [{"w": "and", "s": 107.24}, {"w": "the", "s": 107.32}, {"w": "numbers", "s": 107.4}, {"w": "are", "s": 107.66}, {"w": "a", "s": 107.94}, {"w": "guide", "s": 108.06}, {"w": "not", "s": 108.62}, {"w": "a", "s": 108.82}, {"w": "rule", "s": 108.92}, {"w": "if", "s": 109.16}, {"w": "shorter", "s": 109.74}, {"w": "weights", "s": 109.96}, {"w": "feel", "s": 110.3}, {"w": "right", "s": 110.56}, {"w": "for", "s": 110.78}, {"w": "your", "s": 110.96}, {"w": "family", "s": 111.12}, {"w": "use", "s": 111.86}, {"w": "them", "s": 112.0}, {"w": "what", "s": 112.74}, {"w": "matters", "s": 112.74}, {"w": "most", "s": 112.9}, {"w": "is", "s": 113.42}, {"w": "that", "s": 113.64}, {"w": "the", "s": 113.78}, {"w": "weights", "s": 113.9}, {"w": "grow", "s": 114.12}, {"w": "slowly", "s": 114.38}, {"w": "and", "s": 115.3}, {"w": "you", "s": 115.34}, {"w": "stay", "s": 115.56}, {"w": "consistent", "s": 115.84}]}, {"n": "15", "text": "I put a free printable version of this chart on ferbertimer.com, with space to write down each night. It's one page, and it lives on our fridge.", "screen": "Printable chart page, ferbertimer.com", "start": 116.96, "end": 124.58, "words": [{"w": "i", "s": 116.96}, {"w": "put", "s": 117.02}, {"w": "a", "s": 117.18}, {"w": "free", "s": 117.26}, {"w": "printable", "s": 117.5}, {"w": "version", "s": 117.94}, {"w": "of", "s": 118.3}, {"w": "this", "s": 118.46}, {"w": "chart", "s": 118.62}, {"w": "on", "s": 118.9}, {"w": "ferber", "s": 119.16}, {"w": "timer", "s": 119.54}, {"w": "com", "s": 119.94}, {"w": "with", "s": 120.64}, {"w": "space", "s": 120.88}, {"w": "to", "s": 121.12}, {"w": "write", "s": 121.38}, {"w": "down", "s": 121.54}, {"w": "each", "s": 121.8}, {"w": "night", "s": 122.0}, {"w": "its", "s": 122.84}, {"w": "one", "s": 122.96}, {"w": "page", "s": 123.12}, {"w": "and", "s": 123.4}, {"w": "it", "s": 123.78}, {"w": "lives", "s": 123.86}, {"w": "on", "s": 124.02}, {"w": "our", "s": 124.26}, {"w": "fridge", "s": 124.36}]}, {"n": "16", "text": "And if you'd rather not do the math at two in the morning, my app, Check In, times every wait and alerts you on your lock screen when it's time to go in.", "screen": "App countdown screen, App Store badge", "start": 125.2, "end": 132.66, "words": [{"w": "and", "s": 125.2}, {"w": "if", "s": 125.24}, {"w": "youd", "s": 125.34}, {"w": "rather", "s": 125.48}, {"w": "not", "s": 125.62}, {"w": "do", "s": 126.0}, {"w": "the", "s": 126.16}, {"w": "math", "s": 126.28}, {"w": "at", "s": 126.46}, {"w": "two", "s": 126.66}, {"w": "in", "s": 126.82}, {"w": "the", "s": 126.94}, {"w": "morning", "s": 127.0}, {"w": "my", "s": 127.56}, {"w": "app", "s": 127.76}, {"w": "check", "s": 128.3}, {"w": "in", "s": 128.52}, {"w": "times", "s": 129.08}, {"w": "every", "s": 129.38}, {"w": "weight", "s": 129.7}, {"w": "and", "s": 130.22}, {"w": "alerts", "s": 130.32}, {"w": "you", "s": 130.54}, {"w": "on", "s": 130.82}, {"w": "your", "s": 130.96}, {"w": "lock", "s": 131.08}, {"w": "screen", "s": 131.26}, {"w": "when", "s": 131.6}, {"w": "its", "s": 131.78}, {"w": "time", "s": 131.98}, {"w": "to", "s": 132.14}, {"w": "go", "s": 132.32}, {"w": "in", "s": 132.48}]}, {"n": "17", "text": "Good luck tonight. You've got this.", "screen": "End card: ferbertimer.com, \"Check In: Baby Sleep Timer\"", "start": 133.08, "end": 134.74, "words": [{"w": "good", "s": 133.08}, {"w": "luck", "s": 133.2}, {"w": "tonight", "s": 133.36}, {"w": "youve", "s": 134.08}, {"w": "got", "s": 134.36}, {"w": "this", "s": 134.5}]}], "a2": [{"n": "01", "text": "It's two in the morning. Bedtime went okay, and now your baby is crying again. What do you do?", "screen": "Dim night scene, clock at 2:00", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.82, "words": [{"w": "its", "s": 0.0}, {"w": "two", "s": 0.26}, {"w": "in", "s": 0.48}, {"w": "the", "s": 0.68}, {"w": "morning", "s": 0.7}, {"w": "bedtime", "s": 1.62}, {"w": "went", "s": 2.06}, {"w": "okay", "s": 2.22}, {"w": "and", "s": 2.54}, {"w": "now", "s": 3.06}, {"w": "your", "s": 3.38}, {"w": "baby", "s": 3.52}, {"w": "is", "s": 3.8}, {"w": "crying", "s": 4.0}, {"w": "again", "s": 4.28}, {"w": "what", "s": 5.3}, {"w": "do", "s": 5.44}, {"w": "you", "s": 5.52}, {"w": "do", "s": 5.62}]}, {"n": "02", "text": "I'm a parent who sleep trained our baby with the Ferber method, and I built a timer app for it called Check In. Night wakings were the moment that tested us most. Here's the plan we followed.", "screen": "\u201cMade by a parent\u201d; small \"Check In\" corner tag stays for the rest of the video", "start": 6.6, "end": 16.52, "words": [{"w": "im", "s": 6.6}, {"w": "a", "s": 6.86}, {"w": "parent", "s": 6.92}, {"w": "who", "s": 7.18}, {"w": "sleep", "s": 7.4}, {"w": "trained", "s": 7.64}, {"w": "our", "s": 7.88}, {"w": "baby", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "with", "s": 8.3}, {"w": "the", "s": 8.56}, {"w": "ferber", "s": 8.7}, {"w": "method", "s": 9.04}, {"w": "and", "s": 9.72}, {"w": "i", "s": 9.88}, {"w": "built", "s": 9.98}, {"w": "a", "s": 10.12}, {"w": "timer", "s": 10.28}, {"w": "app", "s": 10.58}, {"w": "for", "s": 10.8}, {"w": "it", "s": 11.06}, {"w": "called", "s": 11.24}, {"w": "check", "s": 11.46}, {"w": "in", "s": 11.68}, {"w": "night", "s": 12.4}, {"w": "wakings", "s": 12.68}, {"w": "were", "s": 13.0}, {"w": "the", "s": 13.32}, {"w": "moment", "s": 13.44}, {"w": "that", "s": 13.8}, {"w": "tested", "s": 14.04}, {"w": "us", "s": 14.3}, {"w": "most", "s": 14.62}, {"w": "heres", "s": 15.54}, {"w": "the", "s": 15.78}, {"w": "plan", "s": 15.9}, {"w": "we", "s": 16.1}, {"w": "followed", "s": 16.26}]}, {"n": "03", "text": "The short answer: treat a night waking just like bedtime, using the same night's chart.", "screen": "\u201cSame plan as bedtime\u201d", "start": 17.3, "end": 21.84, "words": [{"w": "the", "s": 17.3}, {"w": "short", "s": 17.3}, {"w": "answer", "s": 17.46}, {"w": "treat", "s": 18.44}, {"w": "a", "s": 18.46}, {"w": "night", "s": 18.64}, {"w": "waking", "s": 18.78}, {"w": "just", "s": 19.04}, {"w": "like", "s": 19.48}, {"w": "bedtime", "s": 19.76}, {"w": "using", "s": 20.5}, {"w": "the", "s": 20.72}, {"w": "same", "s": 20.92}, {"w": "nights", "s": 21.18}, {"w": "chart", "s": 21.68}]}, {"n": "04", "text": "That means you start again from the first wait for that night. Not where you left off at bedtime. The first wait.", "screen": "Chart row highlights its first number", "start": 22.38, "end": 28.44, "words": [{"w": "that", "s": 22.38}, {"w": "means", "s": 22.54}, {"w": "you", "s": 22.78}, {"w": "start", "s": 23.08}, {"w": "again", "s": 23.28}, {"w": "from", "s": 23.56}, {"w": "the", "s": 23.86}, {"w": "first", "s": 24.0}, {"w": "wait", "s": 24.3}, {"w": "for", "s": 24.58}, {"w": "that", "s": 24.82}, {"w": "night", "s": 24.98}, {"w": "not", "s": 25.6}, {"w": "where", "s": 25.9}, {"w": "you", "s": 26.12}, {"w": "left", "s": 26.24}, {"w": "off", "s": 26.4}, {"w": "at", "s": 26.6}, {"w": "bedtime", "s": 26.76}, {"w": "the", "s": 27.54}, {"w": "first", "s": 27.78}, {"w": "wait", "s": 28.1}]}, {"n": "05", "text": "So on night two, a two a.m. waking starts at five minutes. Then ten. Then twelve, repeating until they're asleep.", "screen": "Night 2 row: 5, 10, 12", "start": 28.94, "end": 36.18, "words": [{"w": "so", "s": 28.94}, {"w": "on", "s": 29.18}, {"w": "night", "s": 29.52}, {"w": "two", "s": 29.68}, {"w": "a", "s": 30.44}, {"w": "2", "s": 30.52}, {"w": "a", "s": 30.7}, {"w": "m", "s": 30.9}, {"w": "waking", "s": 31.32}, {"w": "starts", "s": 31.32}, {"w": "at", "s": 31.7}, {"w": "five", "s": 31.9}, {"w": "minutes", "s": 32.18}, {"w": "then", "s": 33.02}, {"w": "10", "s": 33.18}, {"w": "then", "s": 33.9}, {"w": "12", "s": 34.14}, {"w": "repeating", "s": 34.84}, {"w": "until", "s": 35.18}, {"w": "theyre", "s": 35.6}, {"w": "asleep", "s": 35.94}]}, {"n": "06", "text": "Before you start the timer, give it a moment. Lots of babies stir, fuss briefly, and settle on their own. Only start counting once it's real crying.", "screen": "\u201cWait for real crying\u201d", "start": 37.12, "end": 45.68, "words": [{"w": "before", "s": 37.12}, {"w": "you", "s": 37.12}, {"w": "start", "s": 37.36}, {"w": "the", "s": 37.56}, {"w": "timer", "s": 37.74}, {"w": "give", "s": 38.38}, {"w": "it", "s": 38.56}, {"w": "a", "s": 38.68}, {"w": "moment", "s": 38.76}, {"w": "lots", "s": 39.56}, {"w": "of", "s": 39.74}, {"w": "babies", "s": 39.94}, {"w": "stir", "s": 40.18}, {"w": "fuss", "s": 41.02}, {"w": "briefly", "s": 41.28}, {"w": "and", "s": 41.98}, {"w": "settle", "s": 42.14}, {"w": "on", "s": 42.36}, {"w": "their", "s": 42.6}, {"w": "own", "s": 42.72}, {"w": "only", "s": 43.48}, {"w": "start", "s": 43.62}, {"w": "counting", "s": 43.96}, {"w": "once", "s": 44.38}, {"w": "its", "s": 44.72}, {"w": "real", "s": 45.02}, {"w": "crying", "s": 45.28}]}, {"n": "07", "text": "The check-ins are the same as bedtime. One or two minutes, low light, calm voice, a pat. Then out, even if they're still crying.", "screen": "Check-in icon, \"1 to 2 minutes\"", "start": 46.48, "end": 54.74, "words": [{"w": "the", "s": 46.48}, {"w": "check", "s": 46.54}, {"w": "ins", "s": 46.7}, {"w": "are", "s": 46.94}, {"w": "the", "s": 47.14}, {"w": "same", "s": 47.26}, {"w": "as", "s": 47.5}, {"w": "bedtime", "s": 47.7}, {"w": "one", "s": 48.6}, {"w": "or", "s": 48.8}, {"w": "two", "s": 48.92}, {"w": "minutes", "s": 49.1}, {"w": "low", "s": 49.82}, {"w": "light", "s": 50.02}, {"w": "calm", "s": 50.86}, {"w": "voice", "s": 50.94}, {"w": "a", "s": 51.76}, {"w": "pat", "s": 51.88}, {"w": "then", "s": 52.52}, {"w": "out", "s": 52.76}, {"w": "even", "s": 53.44}, {"w": "if", "s": 53.74}, {"w": "theyre", "s": 54.0}, {"w": "still", "s": 54.16}, {"w": "crying", "s": 54.4}]}, {"n": "08", "text": "The hardest part at two a.m. is doubt. Are they hungry? Is something wrong?", "screen": "Question marks fade in", "start": 55.5, "end": 59.84, "words": [{"w": "the", "s": 55.5}, {"w": "hardest", "s": 55.58}, {"w": "part", "s": 55.86}, {"w": "at", "s": 56.16}, {"w": "2", "s": 56.32}, {"w": "a", "s": 56.5}, {"w": "m", "s": 56.66}, {"w": "is", "s": 57.08}, {"w": "doubt", "s": 57.2}, {"w": "are", "s": 57.98}, {"w": "they", "s": 58.22}, {"w": "hungry", "s": 58.36}, {"w": "is", "s": 59.22}, {"w": "something", "s": 59.32}, {"w": "wrong", "s": 59.54}]}, {"n": "09", "text": "If your pediatrician has said your baby still needs a night feed, feed them. Then put them back down awake, and if they cry, the waits start again from the first one.", "screen": "\u201cFeed if needed, then back down awake\u201d", "start": 60.56, "end": 69.62, "words": [{"w": "if", "s": 60.56}, {"w": "your", "s": 60.7}, {"w": "pediatrician", "s": 60.8}, {"w": "has", "s": 61.52}, {"w": "said", "s": 61.66}, {"w": "your", "s": 61.86}, {"w": "baby", "s": 62.02}, {"w": "still", "s": 62.28}, {"w": "needs", "s": 62.58}, {"w": "a", "s": 62.88}, {"w": "night", "s": 63.0}, {"w": "feed", "s": 63.16}, {"w": "feed", "s": 63.72}, {"w": "them", "s": 64.04}, {"w": "then", "s": 64.74}, {"w": "put", "s": 64.92}, {"w": "them", "s": 65.26}, {"w": "back", "s": 65.44}, {"w": "down", "s": 65.62}, {"w": "awake", "s": 65.94}, {"w": "and", "s": 66.76}, {"w": "if", "s": 66.94}, {"w": "they", "s": 67.06}, {"w": "cry", "s": 67.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 67.92}, {"w": "wait", "s": 67.96}, {"w": "start", "s": 68.14}, {"w": "again", "s": 68.4}, {"w": "from", "s": 68.7}, {"w": "the", "s": 68.96}, {"w": "first", "s": 69.1}, {"w": "one", "s": 69.36}]}, {"n": "10", "text": "If they seem sick or something feels off, go in and comfort them. You can pick the plan back up when they're well.", "screen": "\u201cSick? Comfort first.\u201d", "start": 70.2, "end": 76.14, "words": [{"w": "if", "s": 70.2}, {"w": "they", "s": 70.3}, {"w": "seem", "s": 70.46}, {"w": "sick", "s": 70.68}, {"w": "or", "s": 71.08}, {"w": "something", "s": 71.34}, {"w": "feels", "s": 71.64}, {"w": "off", "s": 71.9}, {"w": "go", "s": 72.6}, {"w": "in", "s": 72.82}, {"w": "and", "s": 73.04}, {"w": "comfort", "s": 73.22}, {"w": "them", "s": 73.54}, {"w": "you", "s": 74.3}, {"w": "can", "s": 74.4}, {"w": "pick", "s": 74.5}, {"w": "the", "s": 74.68}, {"w": "plan", "s": 74.86}, {"w": "back", "s": 75.08}, {"w": "up", "s": 75.34}, {"w": "when", "s": 75.56}, {"w": "theyre", "s": 75.76}, {"w": "well", "s": 75.94}]}, {"n": "11", "text": "Otherwise, the most helpful thing you can do is decide this in daylight. Agree with your partner on the plan, and on whose turn it is tonight, before bedtime.", "screen": "Two phones, \"Who's on duty tonight?\"", "start": 76.68, "end": 85.28, "words": [{"w": "otherwise", "s": 76.68}, {"w": "the", "s": 77.1}, {"w": "most", "s": 77.5}, {"w": "helpful", "s": 77.78}, {"w": "thing", "s": 78.06}, {"w": "you", "s": 78.42}, {"w": "can", "s": 78.54}, {"w": "do", "s": 78.7}, {"w": "is", "s": 78.92}, {"w": "decide", "s": 79.2}, {"w": "this", "s": 79.42}, {"w": "in", "s": 79.78}, {"w": "daylight", "s": 80.02}, {"w": "agree", "s": 81.06}, {"w": "with", "s": 81.26}, {"w": "your", "s": 81.44}, {"w": "partner", "s": 81.54}, {"w": "on", "s": 81.82}, {"w": "the", "s": 82.04}, {"w": "plan", "s": 82.14}, {"w": "and", "s": 82.38}, {"w": "on", "s": 82.78}, {"w": "whose", "s": 82.92}, {"w": "turn", "s": 83.14}, {"w": "it", "s": 83.44}, {"w": "is", "s": 83.6}, {"w": "tonight", "s": 83.72}, {"w": "before", "s": 84.3}, {"w": "bedtime", "s": 84.64}]}, {"n": "12", "text": "And remember, crying after a check-in doesn't mean it isn't working. You went in to reassure, not to make it stop.", "screen": "\u201cCrying after a check-in is normal\u201d", "start": 85.7, "end": 92.42, "words": [{"w": "and", "s": 85.7}, {"w": "remember", "s": 85.94}, {"w": "crying", "s": 86.7}, {"w": "after", "s": 86.98}, {"w": "a", "s": 87.4}, {"w": "check", "s": 87.54}, {"w": "in", "s": 87.72}, {"w": "doesnt", "s": 87.94}, {"w": "mean", "s": 88.44}, {"w": "it", "s": 88.62}, {"w": "isnt", "s": 88.78}, {"w": "working", "s": 89.02}, {"w": "you", "s": 89.98}, {"w": "went", "s": 90.04}, {"w": "in", "s": 90.18}, {"w": "to", "s": 90.34}, {"w": "reassure", "s": 90.48}, {"w": "not", "s": 91.38}, {"w": "to", "s": 91.62}, {"w": "make", "s": 91.84}, {"w": "it", "s": 91.98}, {"w": "stop", "s": 92.1}]}, {"n": "13", "text": "Most families see night wakings ease within the first week. Some nights in the middle are harder. That's normal too.", "screen": "Bars easing over a week", "start": 93.06, "end": 99.1, "words": [{"w": "most", "s": 93.06}, {"w": "families", "s": 93.22}, {"w": "see", "s": 93.62}, {"w": "night", "s": 93.96}, {"w": "wakings", "s": 94.16}, {"w": "ease", "s": 94.46}, {"w": "within", "s": 94.78}, {"w": "the", "s": 95.08}, {"w": "first", "s": 95.28}, {"w": "week", "s": 95.54}, {"w": "some", "s": 96.42}, {"w": "nights", "s": 96.64}, {"w": "in", "s": 96.84}, {"w": "the", "s": 97.04}, {"w": "middle", "s": 97.12}, {"w": "are", "s": 97.34}, {"w": "harder", "s": 97.56}, {"w": "thats", "s": 98.38}, {"w": "normal", "s": 98.62}, {"w": "too", "s": 98.76}]}, {"n": "14", "text": "At two a.m., nobody wants to do math. There's a free web timer on ferbertimer.com, and my app, Check In, restarts the waits for a night waking automatically and alerts you on your lock screen.", "screen": "Web timer, then app's \"Woke up\" screen", "start": 99.74, "end": 110.88, "words": [{"w": "at", "s": 99.74}, {"w": "2", "s": 99.82}, {"w": "a", "s": 100.04}, {"w": "m", "s": 100.2}, {"w": "nobody", "s": 100.76}, {"w": "wants", "s": 101.08}, {"w": "to", "s": 101.34}, {"w": "do", "s": 101.58}, {"w": "math", "s": 101.7}, {"w": "theres", "s": 102.6}, {"w": "a", "s": 102.74}, {"w": "free", "s": 102.82}, {"w": "web", "s": 103.02}, {"w": "timer", "s": 103.3}, {"w": "on", "s": 103.54}, {"w": "ferber", "s": 103.9}, {"w": "timer", "s": 104.26}, {"w": "com", "s": 104.62}, {"w": "and", "s": 105.36}, {"w": "my", "s": 105.54}, {"w": "app", "s": 105.68}, {"w": "check", "s": 106.18}, {"w": "in", "s": 106.32}, {"w": "restarts", "s": 106.84}, {"w": "the", "s": 107.3}, {"w": "waits", "s": 107.54}, {"w": "for", "s": 107.7}, {"w": "a", "s": 107.98}, {"w": "night", "s": 108.06}, {"w": "waking", "s": 108.22}, {"w": "automatically", "s": 108.46}, {"w": "and", "s": 109.1}, {"w": "alerts", "s": 109.66}, {"w": "you", "s": 109.88}, {"w": "on", "s": 110.16}, {"w": "your", "s": 110.28}, {"w": "lock", "s": 110.38}, {"w": "screen", "s": 110.54}]}, {"n": "15", "text": "Hang in there. The nights do get shorter.", "screen": "End card: ferbertimer.com, \"Check In: Baby Sleep Timer\"", "start": 111.34, "end": 113.6, "words": [{"w": "hang", "s": 111.34}, {"w": "in", "s": 111.6}, {"w": "there", "s": 111.76}, {"w": "the", "s": 112.4}, {"w": "nights", "s": 112.48}, {"w": "do", "s": 112.64}, {"w": "get", "s": 113.06}, {"w": "shorter", "s": 113.34}]}], "a3": [{"n": "01", "text": "When we sleep trained our baby with the Ferber method, I kept losing track of time at two in the morning. So I built the timer I wanted.", "screen": "App icon, \"Made by a parent\"", "start": 0.0, "end": 7.34, "words": [{"w": "when", "s": 0.0}, {"w": "we", "s": 0.14}, {"w": "sleep", "s": 0.28}, {"w": "trained", "s": 0.52}, {"w": "our", "s": 0.76}, {"w": "baby", "s": 0.96}, {"w": "with", "s": 1.24}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.46}, {"w": "furber", "s": 1.58}, {"w": "method", "s": 1.92}, {"w": "i", "s": 2.62}, {"w": "kept", "s": 2.76}, {"w": "losing", "s": 2.92}, {"w": "track", "s": 3.26}, {"w": "of", "s": 3.54}, {"w": "time", "s": 3.76}, {"w": "at", "s": 4.06}, {"w": "2", "s": 4.32}, {"w": "in", "s": 4.54}, {"w": "the", "s": 4.7}, {"w": "morning", "s": 4.76}, {"w": "so", "s": 5.66}, {"w": "i", "s": 6.18}, {"w": "built", "s": 6.28}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.44}, {"w": "timer", "s": 6.62}, {"w": "i", "s": 6.86}, {"w": "wanted", "s": 7.12}]}, {"n": "02", "text": "It's called Check In. Here's a night with it.", "screen": "Title card", "start": 8.02, "end": 10.34, "words": [{"w": "its", "s": 8.02}, {"w": "called", "s": 8.14}, {"w": "check", "s": 8.34}, {"w": "in", "s": 8.72}, {"w": "heres", "s": 9.42}, {"w": "a", "s": 9.78}, {"w": "night", "s": 9.84}, {"w": "with", "s": 10.0}, {"w": "it", "s": 10.18}]}, {"n": "03", "text": "You put your baby down and tap Down for the night. Nothing starts yet, because a lot of babies settle without crying.", "screen": "Recording 1, start", "start": 10.8, "end": 16.94, "words": [{"w": "you", "s": 10.8}, {"w": "put", "s": 10.9}, {"w": "your", "s": 11.06}, {"w": "baby", "s": 11.2}, {"w": "down", "s": 11.46}, {"w": "and", "s": 11.76}, {"w": "tap", "s": 12.04}, {"w": "down", "s": 12.26}, {"w": "for", "s": 12.68}, {"w": "the", "s": 13.08}, {"w": "night", "s": 13.22}, {"w": "nothing", "s": 13.88}, {"w": "starts", "s": 14.16}, {"w": "yet", "s": 14.42}, {"w": "because", "s": 14.78}, {"w": "a", "s": 15.16}, {"w": "lot", "s": 15.4}, {"w": "of", "s": 15.58}, {"w": "babies", "s": 15.7}, {"w": "settle", "s": 15.96}, {"w": "without", "s": 16.3}, {"w": "crying", "s": 16.56}]}, {"n": "04", "text": "If they cry, tap Crying. Now it counts down to your first check-in, using the Ferber chart for tonight.", "screen": "Recording 1, countdown", "start": 17.7, "end": 23.7, "words": [{"w": "if", "s": 17.7}, {"w": "they", "s": 17.72}, {"w": "cry", "s": 17.88}, {"w": "tap", "s": 18.62}, {"w": "crying", "s": 18.78}, {"w": "now", "s": 19.94}, {"w": "it", "s": 20.12}, {"w": "counts", "s": 20.4}, {"w": "down", "s": 20.62}, {"w": "to", "s": 20.96}, {"w": "your", "s": 21.16}, {"w": "first", "s": 21.28}, {"w": "check", "s": 21.52}, {"w": "in", "s": 21.84}, {"w": "using", "s": 22.1}, {"w": "the", "s": 22.44}, {"w": "furber", "s": 22.68}, {"w": "chart", "s": 23.02}, {"w": "for", "s": 23.2}, {"w": "tonight", "s": 23.48}]}, {"n": "05", "text": "The screen stays dark and dim, with big buttons you can hit 